1
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:34,440
Regarding this matter,

2
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:35,920
I have three points on how to handle it.

3
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:37,360
First,

4
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:40,200
we won't interfere with the 396th Brigade's

5
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:42,240
decision on handling Comrade Guo Zijian.

6
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,200
Second,

7
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,880
before the situation is completely clear,

8
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,080
we will not rush to state our position.

9
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,440
Third,

10
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:51,320
the 396th Brigade has already suspended Guo Zijian as

11
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,960
the training camp support team captain.

12
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,000
I suggest

13
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:57,040
the brigade find a temporary replacement.

14
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,400
Understood,

15
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,440
Chief.

16
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,080
But the problem occurred in the group army's training camp.

17
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,280
Are we really going to do nothing about it?

18
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,479
Ling Jun,

19
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,120
if you really want to do something,

20
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:14,840
then hurry up and find out the truth of the matter.

21
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,240
But

22
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:20,560
Guo Zijian himself has already confessed.

23
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,800
Has he?

24
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,680
I just feel

25
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,360
this matter isn't that simple.

26
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,200
It's very suspicious.

27
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,120
I'm talking about my intuition.

28
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,240
You are right, Chief.

29
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:35,400
Out of responsibility to you,

30
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,280
I will look into it immediately.

31
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,880
It's not about being responsible to me.

32
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:40,040
It's about being responsible to Comrade Guo Zijian.

33
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:41,400
You have to know,

34
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,640
if the allegations are proven true,

35
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,680
it at least proves

36
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:48,320
he really isn't the person we're looking for.

37
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:50,480
Chief,

38
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:53,880
why is there always so much trouble surrounding Guo Zijian?

39
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,680
I'm getting a bit confused right now.

40
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,000
I don't know who to believe anymore.

41
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:59,440
The more critical the moment, the calmer we must be.

42
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,480
We cannot let superficial appearances

43
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,440
affect our inner judgment.

44
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,000
You are right, Chief.

45
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,640
Old Suo,

46
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:14,160
although the Party Committee has made a resolution,

47
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,720
I still feel that for Guo Zijian,

48
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,080
it's too harsh.

49
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,800
Commissar, you are a veteran political worker

50
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,720
and you cherish talent,

51
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:25,200
so I can understand how you feel.

52
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:29,000
With a major demerit and double demotion,

53
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,080
Guo Zijian's military career

54
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,360
can basically be considered over.

55
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,560
After all,

56
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,640
once such a punishment is announced,

57
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:38,800
even with superhuman abilities, he can hardly recover.

58
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,360
With his arrogant and conceited personality,

59
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:42,720
if we don't rein him in,

60
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,320
he'll struggle to advance much further in the military.

61
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,600
You must know,

62
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,080
the higher the position,

63
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,600
the greater the responsibility.

64
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,480
As for this matter,

65
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,080
I still have to report it to Deputy Commander Liang.

66
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,000
No matter what,

67
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,360
he thinks highly of Guo Zijian.

68
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,520
Even leaders have times when they misjudge.

69
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,400
Even Zhuge Liang misjudged people.

70
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,720
Or else how did he lose Jieting?

71
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:04,080
Consider it

72
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,120
us digging up this landmine for him.

73
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,600
This way,

74
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:10,200
our 396th Brigade

75
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,040
in the group army

76
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,720
is going to be famous again.

77
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,600
No, I mean, Commissar,

78
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:17,240
you don't think I'm deliberately targeting him, do you?

79
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,360
I never thought that.

80
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,560
I just feel sorry for Guo Zijian.

81
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,600
His situation...

82
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:23,680
Who can he blame?

83
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,440
Didn't he bring this upon himself?

84
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,400
All right then.

85
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,440
As for the disciplinary decision,

86
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,920
once the group army committee approves it,

87
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,560
we'll convene a cadre meeting immediately.

88
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,560
We'll have Guo Zijian make a self-criticism first,

89
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,640
then announce the disciplinary decision against him.

90
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,200
Okay.

91
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,240
The training camp still has a lot of things to do.

92
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,240
I'll be going now.

93
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,040
Old Suo,

94
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,640
to tell you the truth,

95
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,120
you've been so exhausted lately,

96
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,680
I really didn't want you to go.

97
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,760
But considering that this training camp

98
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,560
will be very helpful for your future,

99
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:51,640
I still support it.

100
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,760
Thank you for understanding, Commissar.

101
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,360
Reporting.

102
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,640
The door's unlocked.

103
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:15,000
Commander.

104
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,240
Commander.

105
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:19,480
Why did you confess to Deputy Commander Suo

106
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,320
that you're the one who beat up Liu Wangyuan?

107
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,960
Commander, this has nothing to do with you.

108
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,560
We can't let you take the blame.

109
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,080
Exactly.

110
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:24,520
Yeah.

111
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,120
Yeah.

112
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,080
Last night, we...

113
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:28,960
...were trying to teach Yang Maolin a lesson.

114
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,320
But as luck would have it, he didn't show up.

115
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,240
Liu Wangyuan came instead.

116
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,600
We...

117
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:34,680
...jumped the wrong guy.

118
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,560
No need to explain.

119
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,680
I know everything.

120
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:40,040
But even if we got the wrong guy, we don't regret it.

121
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,800
He had it coming for always targeting you.

122
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,440
Liu Wangyuan already had a problem with me.

123
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,120
No matter who jumped him,

124
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,920
he'd assume it was me.

125
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:49,440
This incident...

126
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,400
...is inevitably tied to me anyway.

127
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,040
If I don't take the fall, who will?

128
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,240
But...

129
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,120
Look, Commander.

130
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:58,040
They have absolutely no proof right now.

131
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,560
As long as we stick to our guns,

132
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,520
what can they do to us?

133
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,520
Why take the fall for us?

134
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,800
You might fool others,

135
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,400
but can you fool yourselves?

136
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,240
Fine.

137
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:13,000
We'll go turn ourselves in to Deputy Commander Suo.

138
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,400
Come back here!

139
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:18,920
You're out of line!

140
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,760
Didn't you say

141
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,920
that only if you stay in the army,

142
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:30,080
your girlfriend would agree to marry you?

143
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:33,320
Commander Guo,

144
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:34,800
I, Lin Yihu,

145
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:37,280
would rather stay single my whole life

146
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:40,080
than let you take the fall for me.

147
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,120
Enough.

148
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,120
For this incident,

149
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:46,200
I have to be the one to take responsibility.

150
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:49,200
At worst, I'll be demoted.

151
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,960
If it comes to it,

152
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,040
I can always transfer to civilian work.

153
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:53,960
There's more than one path

154
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:54,920
laid out in front of me.

155
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,720
What about you guys?

156
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,840
Have you thought about the consequences?

157
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,360
A real man takes responsibility for his actions.

158
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,440
At worst, we'll be discharged.

159
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:04,880
We'll be discharged.

160
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,600
Discharged?

161
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,760
You make it sound so easy.

162
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,440
Even if you go to the commanders now,

163
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,080
they'll still think

164
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,600
you're just covering for me.

165
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:20,440
I'm the root cause of this whole incident.

166
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,760
If you're forcibly discharged,

167
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,760
it will be a stain on your records forever.

168
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,560
Can you bear that?

169
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:29,720
This ends here.

170
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,680
I'll say it again.

171
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:33,520
Focus on your training.

172
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,080
Don't embarrass the First Battalion.

173
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,280
Commander Guo, we're sorry.

174
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:38,960
None of us

175
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,440
expected things to blow up like this.

176
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:46,600
Comrades,

177
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:49,160
please, remember this.

178
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:51,160
No matter what you do in the future,

179
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,920
use your heads first.

180
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:56,160
You can't make mistakes like this again.

181
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:59,120
I can can't cover for you forever.

182
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,360
Real men don't shed tears so easily.

183
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:08,240
Look at you.

184
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:11,840
Go back now.

185
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,240
I need to take this call.

186
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,240
Now get out of here.

187
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,200
Let's go.

188
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,159
Sergeant.

189
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,120
What do we do now?

190
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,679
Everyone heard it just now.

191
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:45,440
We can fool others, but not ourselves.

192
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,840
Let's go clear Battalion Commander Guo's name.

193
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:51,360
Are you in?

194
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,080
We're in!

195
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:52,560
We're in!

196
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:53,120
Let's go!

197
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,120
Guo Zijian.

198
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,880
A dirty trick like this...

199
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:00,640
I'd never believe you did it.

200
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:02,040
I'm telling you,

201
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:03,400
you must stay calm.

202
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:05,880
Don't let Liu Wangyuan throw you off track.

203
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,480
Don't worry, I won't.

204
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:10,480
At a time like this, you must

205
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,000
control that temper of yours.

206
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,080
Explain things properly to your superiors. Hear me?

207
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,440
I did what I did.

208
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,880
What's there to explain?

209
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,080
At a time like this,

210
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,080
how can you still say that?

211
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,600
Forget it. Whatever happens, happens.

212
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:38,520
Guo Zijian.

213
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:39,920
Come here for a second.

214
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:51,400
Are you here to laugh at me,

215
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,200
or to get revenge for Liu Wangyuan?

216
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:55,040
Have you lost your mind?

217
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:57,640
Are you sick?

218
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,080
Maybe.

219
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:01,480
And it's pretty serious.

220
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:02,960
Wipe that smirk off your face.

221
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:10,680
To be honest,

222
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,240
when I heard you were the support captain at the training camp,

223
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:16,040
I felt quite sad.

224
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:18,280
Don't get me wrong.

225
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:19,200
Not for you.

226
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,040
For myself.

227
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,520
For losing a chance

228
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:25,360
to defeat you on the battlefield.

229
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,680
I thought it was a pity.

230
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,120
I thought you, Guo Zijian,

231
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,280
were biding your time.

232
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:34,880
I didn't expect this.

233
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:36,520
What?

234
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,640
Now you're digging a hole

235
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:39,960
to bury yourself, huh?

236
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:41,040
I didn't expect it either.

237
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,440
So what?

238
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:45,920
Do I owe you an apology

239
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,840
for disappointing Battalion Commander Jiang?

240
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:50,080
You weren't the one who beat him up.

241
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:53,600
Am I wrong?

242
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:57,880
You, Guo Zijian, only slap people in public.

243
00:10:58,560 --> 00:10:59,440
Putting a sack over someone's head?

244
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:01,920
That's unnecessary.

245
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,400
You know me pretty well.

246
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:06,320
Well?

247
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,480
Satisfying, is it?

248
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,120
Extremely satisfying.

249
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,560
Sticking your neck out for someone,

250
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,520
taking the blame for them,

251
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:12,840
is it satisfying?

252
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,760
What about all that tough talk?

253
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,520
Your ideals?

254
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,000
Pursuits?

255
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:25,880
Ambitions?

256
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,280
Reform?

257
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,720
If it were you,

258
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,720
what would you do?

259
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,000
That's the whole story.

260
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,320
We're the ones who threw a sack over Liu Wangyuan.

261
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,280
It had nothing to do with Battalion Commander Guo.

262
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:18,160
He was afraid this incident would affect

263
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:19,440
our future careers in the military,

264
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,360
so he took the blame for us.

265
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:24,720
Is that true?

266
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:25,720
Yes, sir.

267
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,320
These pants

268
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:34,880
are the ones I wore that night.

269
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,160
When we threw the sack over him,

270
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,920
they accidentally got splashed with mud.

271
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,480
Lin Yihu.

272
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:47,880
Do you have any idea

273
00:12:47,880 --> 00:12:50,280
what the consequences are for assaulting a superior officer?

274
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,360
Sir, we...

275
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,320
we didn't actually beat him.

276
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:53,720
We just

277
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,560
pushed Section Chief Liu.

278
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,200
Then we realized we bagged the wrong guy,

279
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,360
so we quickly ran away.

280
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,920
Then where did his injuries come from?

281
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:01,080
We really don't know.

282
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:02,920
Sir, even if you

283
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,280
gave me ten times the courage,

284
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,040
we'd never dare attack a superior.

285
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:08,760
Then why was Guo Zijian at the scene?

286
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:11,240
He wasn't.

287
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,960
Battalion Commander Guo wasn't at the scene.

288
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,240
It was just us there.

289
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,320
Look at yourselves.

290
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,800
You can't answer a single question,

291
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:19,800
and your story is full of holes.

292
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,560
All you know is how to take the blame.

293
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:24,200
Aren't you afraid of being disciplined?

294
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:25,640
Sir.

295
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,520
It's not that we're taking the blame.

296
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:29,480
We're the ones who actually did this.

297
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,080
It has nothing to do with Battalion Commander Guo.

298
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:32,360
Right, nothing at all.

299
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,760
As for being disciplined,

300
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:35,400
we were the ones in the wrong first.

301
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:37,160
I plead guilty and accept any punishment.

302
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,320
But I hope you see the truth, sir,

303
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:41,520
and don't wrongly accuse Battalion Commander Guo.

304
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:43,680
Enough.

305
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,000
You are suspended from all training for now.

306
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,480
Wait for the disciplinary decision.

307
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:48,320
Dismissed.

308
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:49,080
Yes, sir!

309
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,040
Left face!

310
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:55,840
Forward march!

311
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:05,160
I think

312
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,120
what Lin Yihu and the guys said

313
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,440
is actually quite credible.

314
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:10,040
I actually think

315
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,920
it's completely unbelievable.

316
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,440
The things they said

317
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:15,600
make absolutely no sense.

318
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:20,560
They said

319
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:22,560
they arranged to meet Yang Maolin, right?

320
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,560
and mistook someone else for him.

321
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:26,920
Then what about Yang Maolin?

322
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,760
Why wasn't Yang Maolin at the scene?

323
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:31,520
Right?

324
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,760
It can't be that coincidental.

325
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:36,200
Also, they said they didn't hit anyone.

326
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:38,280
If they didn't, where did the injuries come from?

327
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:41,040
I can't speak for Liu Wangyuan on other things,

328
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,080
but on one thing,

329
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,320
I can guarantee.

330
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:45,040
He would never

331
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,120
just to frame others,

332
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,040
injure himself

333
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,240
and get himself all muddy.

334
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,200
He wouldn't go that far.

335
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:52,800
So,

336
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:54,680
these kids

337
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:57,840
just want to take the blame for Guo Zijian,

338
00:14:58,240 --> 00:14:59,680
but are also afraid of the consequences,

339
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:02,520
so they made up these excuses.

340
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,480
They're just kids.

341
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,640
If that's the case,

342
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:08,760
Guo Zijian is quite popular among the troops.

343
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,240
I have to admit,

344
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,680
Guo Zijian is pretty good at that.

345
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,160
No matter where he goes,

346
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:16,000
he always blends right in with the soldiers.

347
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,600
To put it nicely,

348
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:19,240
it's called being loyal.

349
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:20,720
To put it bluntly,

350
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,200
it's forming cliques.

351
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:25,080
Old Suo, you're blowing things out of proportion again.

352
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:28,480
Easy, easy, easy.

353
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,520
Turn, turn, turn.

354
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:30,880
Does it hurt?

355
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:31,440
Ow, ow, ow.

356
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:32,720
It hurts.

357
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,480
Where does it hurt? Tell me.

358
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,560
Right here. My lower back.

359
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:35,280
Here?

360
00:15:35,640 --> 00:15:36,360
Move your hand.

361
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:37,520
Let me take a look, let me take a look.

362
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:40,080
Be gentle.

363
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:43,840
The skin isn't even broken.

364
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,400
So what if it isn't broken?

365
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:49,480
If it were just a scrape, I wouldn't be like this.

366
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:51,240
This is an internal injury now.

367
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,000
It really hurts.

368
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:03,560
Just put it down.

369
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,680
What is it? Go ahead.

370
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:20,360
That's outrageous.

371
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,040
Liu, you know me.

372
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:25,920
As for Guo Zijian,

373
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:28,240
I've never liked him.

374
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:30,720
Let me put it this way.

375
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,760
If I had been there that night,

376
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:36,280
even if that bastard ran a mile away,

377
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:37,320
I would have caught him

378
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:38,560
and beat the crap out of him.

379
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,560
I'd definitely get even for you.

380
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:44,040
It's outrageous!

381
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,520
All right, all right.

382
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:51,360
But Jiang,

383
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:53,760
just for what you just said,

384
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:57,480
you're a true brother to me.

385
00:16:58,800 --> 00:16:59,480
Tell you what,

386
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:00,640
when I get better,

387
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,200
I'll treat you to hot pot.

388
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,880
The usual nine-grid pot,

389
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:04,960
extra spicy and numbing.

390
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:05,680
Sounds good.

391
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:08,760
But then again,

392
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:12,079
this is in the past now.

393
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:14,520
How about...

394
00:17:16,319 --> 00:17:16,800
we just let it go?

395
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:20,880
Forgive and forget.

396
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,040
What do you mean,

397
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:32,400
forgive and forget?

398
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:37,720
So I get beaten up, and I'm in the wrong?

399
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:38,760
That's not what I meant.

400
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:39,520
Then what do you mean?

401
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:42,640
Let me ask you, Jiang.

402
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:44,960
If I just swallow this,

403
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:47,360
how will I, Liu Wangyuan,

404
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,640
ever show my face

405
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:49,880
in our brigade?

406
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:53,080
But right now,

407
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:56,000
we aren't in our brigade.

408
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:00,720
Us and Guo Zijian,

409
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,120
we're comrades now,

410
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:04,920
teammates,

411
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:08,080
in the training camp together.

412
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:09,480
Aren't we?

413
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:11,360
Captain Xu

414
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:13,600
was sent by the group army.

415
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:16,240
If this blows up,

416
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:17,560
what will Captain Xu think?

417
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:19,920
What will the group army think?

418
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:23,680
It'll make our brigade look divided.

419
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:25,920
Whose face are we losing?

420
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:29,040
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo's.

421
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:33,960
The problem is, I'm not the one ruining unity.

422
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,600
He is, right?

423
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:37,800
If I don't demand an explanation,

424
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,880
he'll think he can do whatever he wants.

425
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:42,400
If he can lay a hand on me today,

426
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:44,560
does that mean tomorrow,

427
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:45,680
if he disagrees with the chiefs,

428
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,520
he'll attack them too?

429
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:49,960
Anyway, a guy like him

430
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:51,600
needs to be punished severely.

431
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,440
Otherwise, how will he learn?

432
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:56,520
Liu...

433
00:18:58,080 --> 00:18:58,840
Enough.

434
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:03,080
If you still see me as an old comrade,

435
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,200
don't try to talk me out

436
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:05,880
of this fight.

437
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:10,400
I'm telling you right now,

438
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:13,560
there's no way I'm letting this go.

439
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,360
Okay, okay, okay.

440
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,320
No way.

441
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:19,480
I get it.

442
00:19:20,040 --> 00:19:20,560
All right.

443
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:21,560
You've been wronged.

444
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:22,600
It's okay.

445
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:23,320
Calm down, calm down.

446
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:23,880
Calm down.

447
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:24,720
Let's drop it.

448
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:25,640
Let's not talk about this.

449
00:19:28,280 --> 00:19:29,600
Are you still that ticklish?

450
00:19:29,840 --> 00:19:30,400
Yes!

451
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:32,440
What are you doing?

452
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:45,880
Old Liu,

453
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:52,920
you're full of tricks.

454
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,080
Have some water.

455
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:02,760
Thank you, sir.

456
00:20:03,280 --> 00:20:05,480
How did your Black Mamba turn into a dog?

457
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:06,600
You've got a sharp nose.

458
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:08,040
Sir,

459
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,360
let's skip that for now.

460
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,360
Just give me a straight answer.

461
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:14,400
As for a straight answer...

462
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:15,880
I really can't give you one.

463
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:18,200
Why?

464
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,720
Regarding Guo Zijian hitting someone,

465
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:23,240
he has basically confessed.

466
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:25,920
If you just swoop in and snatch him away,

467
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,600
how would the Party committees save face?

468
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:28,360
You tell me.

469
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:29,840
So,

470
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:32,600
are we really driving Guo Zijian into a corner?

471
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:33,800
No one is driving him.

472
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:35,480
But he hit someone,

473
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,160
and he has to face the consequences.

474
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:40,800
Sir,

475
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:43,080
do you really have the heart to see such a great talent

476
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:45,320
ruined just like that?

477
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:46,400
Besides,

478
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:47,760
even if Guo Zijian's

479
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:49,120
retaliatory assault

480
00:20:49,120 --> 00:20:50,120
is a closed case,

481
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:52,240
people can still change, you know.

482
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:53,600
Hand him over to me.

483
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:54,840
I'm confident I can guide him.

484
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:57,640
If he goes to the 404th Brigade and is still heavily relied on,

485
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:01,240
that would mean our handling of this matter

486
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,680
was too lenient.

487
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:04,960
It's like giving Guo Zijian a personal green light.

488
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:07,520
It does no good for his personal growth.

489
00:21:07,760 --> 00:21:09,600
And regarding the army's personnel appointments,

490
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:11,760
it sets a bad example.

491
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:12,800
Have you thought about that?

492
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:16,440
How about this,

493
00:21:17,280 --> 00:21:18,600
after this whole thing blows over,

494
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:19,280
I'll come back for him.

495
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:20,600
Would that work?

496
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:25,120
Guo Zijian has been demoted.

497
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:27,120
I don't know his state of mind.

498
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:28,400
But

499
00:21:29,120 --> 00:21:30,320
his rank and his age

500
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:32,080
are clearly mismatched now.

501
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:34,600
Can he accept that?

502
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:38,320
If he cracks,

503
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,680
can he get back on his feet?

504
00:21:47,080 --> 00:21:48,880
So we're just giving up on him?

505
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:50,800
No one is giving up on him.

506
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:52,880
If anyone is giving up,

507
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,760
it's him giving up on himself.

508
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,560
I don't think he will.

509
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:08,800
Let's wait and see.

510
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:20,040
Dongfang,

511
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:21,760
Aren't you applying for weekend leave?

512
00:22:22,080 --> 00:22:23,240
What are you watching now?

513
00:22:24,120 --> 00:22:25,360
Come, come, come.

514
00:22:25,360 --> 00:22:25,760
Come over here.

515
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:26,680
What's wrong?

516
00:22:27,480 --> 00:22:30,160
That viral incident from a few days ago

517
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:31,360
where a PLA major

518
00:22:31,360 --> 00:22:33,040
took a college student's cooking pot

519
00:22:33,040 --> 00:22:34,200
and kicked it over,

520
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:35,520
now has a follow-up report.

521
00:22:35,760 --> 00:22:37,280
Just a few hours ago,

522
00:22:37,280 --> 00:22:39,880
the full video was posted online.

523
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:41,240
After watching this video,

524
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:42,280
I just want to say,

525
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:44,640
forget about kicking his pot,

526
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:48,240
even if he kicked the guy, he deserved it.

527
00:22:48,360 --> 00:22:51,400
Kicking that pot a hundred times wouldn't be too much!

528
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:53,280
Good, at least they have a conscience.

529
00:22:55,320 --> 00:22:56,760
I just don't know if it's too late.

530
00:22:57,360 --> 00:22:58,720
Why is our captain so unlucky?

531
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,600
He should be fine.

532
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:09,320
Did you leak the video?

533
00:23:12,040 --> 00:23:13,600
Are you trying to ruin me?

534
00:23:14,040 --> 00:23:15,600
I didn't want to ruin you.

535
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:16,520
I just

536
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:18,640
didn't want an excellent officer to be wrongly accused.

537
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:21,400
Where are you right now?

538
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:22,560
I'll come find you.

539
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,240
I don't want to see you.

540
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:26,040
Don't ever call me again.

541
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:40,680
Staff Officer Liang,

542
00:23:41,040 --> 00:23:43,080
Do you think our combat case analysis

543
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:43,960
will actually help?

544
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:49,120
The analysis can objectively review

545
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:50,160
every detail of the exercise.

546
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:52,120
It provides the commanders with

547
00:23:52,120 --> 00:23:53,640
a true and reliable basis for judgment,

548
00:23:54,080 --> 00:23:56,560
preventing them from being misled by subjectivity.

549
00:23:58,160 --> 00:24:00,720
So if the facts prove that Guo Zijian

550
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:02,280
didn't delay the decapitation strike,

551
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:03,720
then his guilty conscience,

552
00:24:03,840 --> 00:24:05,160
his fear of Chief Liu's investigation,

553
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:06,920
and his motive for the assault would all vanish.

554
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:10,840
Hurry up then, Staff Officer Liang.

555
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:12,080
I've already finished editing the video.

556
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:13,360
We're just waiting for your written analysis.

557
00:24:14,760 --> 00:24:15,960
I'm working as fast as I can.

558
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:16,920
But no matter how fast I am,

559
00:24:16,920 --> 00:24:18,200
it won't be ready until tomorrow night.

560
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:20,760
I heard the 396th Brigade

561
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:22,360
is holding an officers' meeting the day after tomorrow

562
00:24:22,600 --> 00:24:23,760
to publicly try Guo Zijian.

563
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:25,400
Squad Leader Hong.

564
00:24:26,120 --> 00:24:27,280
Why does everything you say

565
00:24:27,280 --> 00:24:28,240
immediately sound so twisted?

566
00:24:28,320 --> 00:24:29,040
What do you mean by "publicly try"?

567
00:24:30,320 --> 00:24:31,720
That's basically what it means.

568
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,440
Guo Zijian's future

569
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,880
is resting entirely in our hands.

570
00:24:36,560 --> 00:24:37,120
But...

571
00:24:37,400 --> 00:24:38,520
I'm just worried that

572
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:40,040
our conclusion alone

573
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:41,680
won't be enough to fully clear his name.

574
00:24:42,280 --> 00:24:44,240
There was absolutely no surveillance at the scene,

575
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:46,240
so we can't prove Guo Zijian wasn't there.

576
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:05,240
The evidence we need

577
00:25:06,120 --> 00:25:08,080
might not just be on the security cameras.

578
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:15,160
I'll go check right now.

579
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:04,720
Guo Zijian, you've really disappointed me.

580
00:26:05,360 --> 00:26:07,200
How could you do something so stupid?

581
00:26:08,080 --> 00:26:09,600
They say every mistake makes you wiser.

582
00:26:09,640 --> 00:26:11,000
So where is your wisdom?

583
00:26:12,160 --> 00:26:12,680
Commissar.

584
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:15,240
Whether I'm demoted in position or rank,

585
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,280
I accept it.

586
00:26:16,400 --> 00:26:17,640
I can always start over.

587
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:19,080
You really think you can bounce back?

588
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:20,760
Position and rank

589
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:22,640
are prerequisites for military assignments.

590
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:25,000
You tell me, where are we supposed to place you now?

591
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,120
I don't know.

592
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:27,360
I'll follow the organization's orders.

593
00:26:27,360 --> 00:26:28,760
The organization is at a loss too.

594
00:26:29,480 --> 00:26:30,880
A clear path to success,

595
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:32,800
and you turned it into a dead end.

596
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:35,760
You're really something else, Guo Zijian.

597
00:27:33,320 --> 00:27:34,240
Director Xu.

598
00:27:35,560 --> 00:27:37,000
Squad Leader Hong, it's urgent.

599
00:27:37,040 --> 00:27:38,240
Whatever it is, we'll talk when you return.

600
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:39,640
I have something to give you.

601
00:27:40,080 --> 00:27:41,360
About the assault on Section Chief Liu.

602
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:10,520
Everyone, take a break.

603
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,080
The meeting is postponed by half an hour.

604
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,120
Comrades.

605
00:28:23,080 --> 00:28:24,440
The meeting is about to begin.

606
00:28:25,800 --> 00:28:27,240
Once the disciplinary decision

607
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:28,440
against Guo Zijian is publicly announced,

608
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:30,040
we will have

609
00:28:30,360 --> 00:28:32,240
absolutely no room to maneuver.

610
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:34,560
Commissar,

611
00:28:35,360 --> 00:28:36,720
at this critical juncture,

612
00:28:37,040 --> 00:28:39,600
do you think there's still room to maneuver?

613
00:28:41,520 --> 00:28:42,440
The key point is,

614
00:28:42,560 --> 00:28:43,920
since last night,

615
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:46,960
the internet and the group army's command network

616
00:28:47,520 --> 00:28:48,920
have published two items

617
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:51,240
directly related to Guo Zijian.

618
00:28:52,320 --> 00:28:54,640
And when we made this disciplinary decision,

619
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,520
we were undoubtedly influenced

620
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:58,720
by the emotions surrounding these two incidents.

621
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:00,320
Zhanliang,

622
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:02,160
talk about the combat case first.

623
00:29:02,520 --> 00:29:03,080
Understood.

624
00:29:03,720 --> 00:29:04,720
The combat case analysis

625
00:29:04,840 --> 00:29:06,480
posted on the group army's command network

626
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:07,440
by Staff Officer Liang Hong

627
00:29:07,640 --> 00:29:08,240
discusses

628
00:29:08,440 --> 00:29:09,720
the combat segment from the last exercise,

629
00:29:09,920 --> 00:29:12,400
specifically Guo Zijian's final decapitation strike.

630
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:13,440
Currently,

631
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:16,320
it has been pushed to the military-wide

632
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:17,320
command network exchange platform.

633
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:19,440
With comprehensive video footage,

634
00:29:19,840 --> 00:29:20,920
it is currently sparking

635
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:22,080
heated discussions across the military.

636
00:29:23,080 --> 00:29:24,240
Some military academies have stated

637
00:29:24,680 --> 00:29:26,160
their willingness to use this case

638
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,200
as a teaching curriculum.

639
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:28,400
This

640
00:29:28,560 --> 00:29:30,080
also proves from all angles

641
00:29:30,320 --> 00:29:31,600
that the claim of Guo Zijian

642
00:29:31,800 --> 00:29:33,000
deliberately delaying military action

643
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:34,880
to let Long Yuanshan off the hook

644
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:36,480
is sheer nonsense.

645
00:29:38,520 --> 00:29:39,040
Good.

646
00:29:39,560 --> 00:29:40,320
Deputy Commissar Kang,

647
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:42,960
now talk about the pot-kicking incident.

648
00:29:44,880 --> 00:29:45,720
Right now,

649
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:48,080
a full video is circulating online

650
00:29:48,080 --> 00:29:50,000
showing Guo Zijian leading a special ops squad

651
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:51,320
to rescue the college students

652
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:53,840
and the pot-kicking incident.

653
00:29:54,640 --> 00:29:55,600
According to our investigation,

654
00:29:55,600 --> 00:29:57,840
this video from the scene

655
00:29:57,840 --> 00:29:59,480
was uploaded by one of the students.

656
00:30:00,720 --> 00:30:01,800
Public opinion now

657
00:30:01,800 --> 00:30:03,320
has become completely one-sided.

658
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:04,880
Previously on the internet,

659
00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:06,280
those who attacked Guo Zijian,

660
00:30:06,280 --> 00:30:07,120
the major online influencers,

661
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:08,720
have now collectively gone silent.

662
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:10,640
Netizens are saying

663
00:30:10,840 --> 00:30:11,920
that for a pot like this,

664
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,400
kicking it a hundred times isn't too much.

665
00:30:13,760 --> 00:30:16,320
They support the PLA comrades kicking it repeatedly.

666
00:30:16,640 --> 00:30:17,400
Reporting!

667
00:30:18,040 --> 00:30:18,520
Come in.

668
00:30:22,760 --> 00:30:23,560
Reporting to the commanders.

669
00:30:23,560 --> 00:30:24,960
Lin Yihu and others from the 1st Battalion's recon squad

670
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:26,160
tried to crash the meeting but were stopped.

671
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:27,360
Crash the meeting?

672
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:28,480
Where are they?

673
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:29,360
Right outside the door.

674
00:30:33,760 --> 00:30:34,440
Hold on.

675
00:30:36,560 --> 00:30:37,160
Lin Yihu.

676
00:30:37,520 --> 00:30:38,040
Here!

677
00:30:38,360 --> 00:30:39,320
What are you doing?

678
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:41,120
Is this how soldiers behave?

679
00:30:41,480 --> 00:30:42,040
Report!

680
00:30:42,080 --> 00:30:42,640
Speak.

681
00:30:43,520 --> 00:30:44,040
Sir,

682
00:30:44,600 --> 00:30:45,640
I know the consequences.

683
00:30:46,360 --> 00:30:47,760
After this,

684
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:49,600
we might not be soldiers anymore.

685
00:30:50,120 --> 00:30:51,120
But the few of us

686
00:30:51,240 --> 00:30:52,920
really have something to say today.

687
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:55,600
Very well.

688
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:56,840
Go ahead.

689
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:57,960
Commissar,

690
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,240
what happened to Section Chief Liu

691
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:01,240
has absolutely nothing to do with Battalion Commander Guo.

692
00:31:04,240 --> 00:31:04,680
Old Liu,

693
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:05,680
what are you looking at?

694
00:31:06,120 --> 00:31:07,920
The assembly is about to clear your name.

695
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:08,440
What?

696
00:31:08,520 --> 00:31:09,240
Can't you wait a little longer?

697
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:11,080
What name is there to clear?

698
00:31:12,560 --> 00:31:13,960
The brigade party committee handles things fairly.

699
00:31:14,120 --> 00:31:15,280
I trust the organization.

700
00:31:16,280 --> 00:31:17,560
I was just looking...

701
00:31:18,200 --> 00:31:20,840
You were looking at why it keeps getting delayed.

702
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:24,240
Enough with the nonsense!

703
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:28,800
Lin Yihu,

704
00:31:29,840 --> 00:31:31,160
is what you're saying the truth?

705
00:31:31,240 --> 00:31:32,120
If you don't believe me,

706
00:31:32,120 --> 00:31:33,240
you can ask Yang Maolin.

707
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:34,600
If I am lying at all,

708
00:31:34,600 --> 00:31:35,400
I, Lin Yihu,

709
00:31:35,600 --> 00:31:36,480
will offer my head.

710
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:37,360
Assaulting an officer.

711
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:39,240
Do you know the punishment for that?

712
00:31:39,280 --> 00:31:40,920
Commissar, we didn't assault anyone.

713
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:42,840
We were out of line,

714
00:31:42,880 --> 00:31:44,280
and you can punish us however you see fit.

715
00:31:44,280 --> 00:31:45,240
We will fully accept it.

716
00:31:45,240 --> 00:31:46,240
But regarding this matter,

717
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:48,200
our battalion commander cannot be wronged.

718
00:31:48,520 --> 00:31:49,480
Let me remind you,

719
00:31:50,280 --> 00:31:51,320
let me remind all of you,

720
00:31:52,080 --> 00:31:52,880
Guo Zijian

721
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:54,600
is no longer a battalion commander.

722
00:31:55,800 --> 00:31:57,120
Since you say so,

723
00:31:57,800 --> 00:31:58,880
empty words prove nothing.

724
00:31:59,880 --> 00:32:00,640
Do you have evidence?

725
00:32:16,200 --> 00:32:16,800
Lao Xu.

726
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:17,560
Chief.

727
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:19,680
Are there new orders from above?

728
00:32:19,840 --> 00:32:20,800
It has nothing to do with the higher-ups.

729
00:32:20,840 --> 00:32:22,040
I have a few video clips here.

730
00:32:22,080 --> 00:32:23,120
Let's all take a look.

731
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:23,840
All right, let's go.

732
00:32:23,880 --> 00:32:24,200
Okay.

733
00:32:32,400 --> 00:32:33,840
I've seen this video before.

734
00:32:34,560 --> 00:32:35,720
What does this prove?

735
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,600
As for Section Chief Liu getting beaten up,

736
00:32:37,600 --> 00:32:38,520
this has absolutely nothing to do with it.

737
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:40,200
Take it easy, Lao Suo.

738
00:32:40,720 --> 00:32:42,560
Did you see that soldier from the mess squad?

739
00:32:42,880 --> 00:32:43,920
As for this soldier,

740
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:45,040
I questioned him.

741
00:32:45,480 --> 00:32:47,720
He overheard Lin Yihu and Yang Maolin talking.

742
00:32:48,080 --> 00:32:49,120
"Hey, you."

743
00:32:50,360 --> 00:32:51,800
"Squad Leader Wu has something to tell you."

744
00:32:54,200 --> 00:32:54,960
"Like what?"

745
00:32:58,080 --> 00:32:58,960
"Nine o'clock tonight,"

746
00:32:59,200 --> 00:33:00,600
"at the physical training ground."

747
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:02,400
"He'll be waiting for you."

748
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:07,240
What time was Section Chief Liu beaten up again?

749
00:33:07,560 --> 00:33:09,440
According to him, it was

750
00:33:09,840 --> 00:33:10,960
at 8:45.

751
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:13,120
Then that makes sense.

752
00:33:13,760 --> 00:33:14,760
Let's keep watching.

753
00:33:27,280 --> 00:33:29,080
This is from the training unit staff officer.

754
00:33:29,400 --> 00:33:30,560
When he was driving back,

755
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:31,760
his dashcam video

756
00:33:31,800 --> 00:33:32,560
recorded footage that

757
00:33:32,560 --> 00:33:33,320
captured Guo Zijian.

758
00:33:33,320 --> 00:33:36,080
The time shown on the video is 8:51.

759
00:33:37,320 --> 00:33:38,960
This time obviously doesn't match up.

760
00:33:39,640 --> 00:33:40,600
What does this mean?

761
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:41,920
It means

762
00:33:42,120 --> 00:33:43,880
Lin Yihu and the others were telling the truth.

763
00:33:46,360 --> 00:33:47,040
Old Xu,

764
00:33:47,920 --> 00:33:49,400
I'll first do a self-reflection.

765
00:33:50,280 --> 00:33:51,240
The occurrence of this incident

766
00:33:51,720 --> 00:33:52,800
also reflects

767
00:33:52,960 --> 00:33:54,440
that our cadres at every level

768
00:33:54,800 --> 00:33:56,160
have shortcomings in their work.

769
00:33:56,400 --> 00:33:57,960
We were not meticulous or thorough enough.

770
00:33:59,320 --> 00:34:01,080
But I think this also

771
00:34:01,080 --> 00:34:03,080
presents us with a new issue:

772
00:34:03,600 --> 00:34:05,160
how to strengthen in the future

773
00:34:05,360 --> 00:34:06,920
the psychological well-being of our officers and soldiers.

774
00:34:08,679 --> 00:34:10,320
We all need to think carefully about it.

775
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:13,719
This Section Chief Liu

776
00:34:14,120 --> 00:34:15,600
shouldn't just make baseless accusations.

777
00:34:16,600 --> 00:34:18,320
We can't entirely blame Section Chief Liu.

778
00:34:19,120 --> 00:34:21,600
Section Chief Liu and Guo Zijian had conflicts before,

779
00:34:21,639 --> 00:34:22,520
and they've had arguments.

780
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:25,560
So it's understandable that he suspected Guo Zijian.

781
00:34:26,159 --> 00:34:27,239
That's how it is.

782
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:30,840
Now that the matter has been clarified,

783
00:34:31,000 --> 00:34:32,520
how to deal with the people involved

784
00:34:32,880 --> 00:34:34,080
also needs to be carefully decided.

785
00:34:34,520 --> 00:34:35,719
Director Xu is right.

786
00:34:36,040 --> 00:34:37,320
Since the committee members are all here,

787
00:34:37,520 --> 00:34:39,120
let's immediately discuss how to handle this.

788
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:41,560
Staff Officer Liang,

789
00:34:42,120 --> 00:34:43,159
The dashcam video,

790
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:44,280
I handed it over to Director Xu.

791
00:34:50,239 --> 00:34:51,600
Is that your only reaction?

792
00:34:54,199 --> 00:34:56,280
I don't know if this will help Guo Zijian this time.

793
00:35:02,960 --> 00:35:03,720
Staff Officer Liang,

794
00:35:04,520 --> 00:35:05,720
this post of yours

795
00:35:05,880 --> 00:35:07,200
was highlighted and pinned!

796
00:35:11,120 --> 00:35:12,400
Isn't that perfectly normal?

797
00:35:12,600 --> 00:35:13,440
Staff Officer Liang,

798
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:15,800
I really admire your confidence.

799
00:35:16,520 --> 00:35:18,400
But I really didn't expect

800
00:35:18,480 --> 00:35:19,360
that you would post it

801
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:21,480
directly on the group army's combat command network.

802
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:23,360
I thought you'd give it to Director Xu.

803
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:27,080
Our battle case analysis

804
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:29,400
is purely for professional study and exchange.

805
00:35:29,400 --> 00:35:30,400
It's not for anything else.

806
00:35:30,520 --> 00:35:31,200
Right, right, right.

807
00:35:31,560 --> 00:35:33,120
It's just for professional exchange.

808
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,680
You asking me to find evidence

809
00:35:34,800 --> 00:35:36,600
was definitely not to help him either.

810
00:35:36,880 --> 00:35:37,800
It was for

811
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:39,840
upholding justice.

812
00:35:40,120 --> 00:35:40,840
Squad Leader Hong!

813
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:41,840
Here!

814
00:35:43,600 --> 00:35:44,400
Before this afternoon,

815
00:35:44,600 --> 00:35:46,720
send me the assessment plan for the next phase.

816
00:35:49,600 --> 00:35:50,280
What do you mean "huh"?

817
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:51,240
Execute the order!

818
00:35:51,520 --> 00:35:52,280
Yes, sir!

819
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:04,720
Comrades,

820
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:06,640
Section Chief Liu.

821
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:09,080
Following the attack during the night inspection,

822
00:36:10,080 --> 00:36:11,400
the brigade party committee took it very seriously

823
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:13,920
and promptly issued a disciplinary decision,

824
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:15,960
reporting it to the group army party committee.

825
00:36:17,120 --> 00:36:17,880
However,

826
00:36:19,280 --> 00:36:20,440
the parties involved,

827
00:36:21,200 --> 00:36:22,760
out of so-called brotherhood,

828
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:25,240
deliberately concealed the facts,

829
00:36:26,120 --> 00:36:27,680
making the incident complicated

830
00:36:28,600 --> 00:36:30,360
and seriously interfering with the

831
00:36:30,400 --> 00:36:31,680
seriousness and objectivity of the committee's work.

832
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:33,360
Now,

833
00:36:34,440 --> 00:36:36,400
we have gathered sufficient evidence

834
00:36:37,240 --> 00:36:38,680
and clarified all the facts.

835
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:41,240
The brigade party committee has decided

836
00:36:42,560 --> 00:36:44,760
to discipline Lin Yihu, the main person responsible,

837
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:46,080
as follows:

838
00:36:46,680 --> 00:36:47,200
First,

839
00:36:48,120 --> 00:36:49,640
for initiating an attack on an officer,

840
00:36:50,280 --> 00:36:51,280
even though it was accidental,

841
00:36:51,880 --> 00:36:53,480
the brigade party committee has decided

842
00:36:54,240 --> 00:36:57,200
to give Lin Yihu, 1st Battalion acting recon squad leader,

843
00:36:57,480 --> 00:36:59,000
a major administrative demerit,

844
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:00,720
and six months of probation.

845
00:37:01,400 --> 00:37:02,000
Second,

846
00:37:02,640 --> 00:37:04,840
for interfering with the investigation and distorting facts,

847
00:37:05,040 --> 00:37:07,320
instructor Guo Zijian of the training unit is given

848
00:37:08,280 --> 00:37:09,640
an administrative warning.

849
00:37:12,200 --> 00:37:12,680
Comrades,

850
00:37:13,840 --> 00:37:15,040
good news stays indoors,

851
00:37:15,560 --> 00:37:16,400
while bad news travels fast.

852
00:37:17,160 --> 00:37:17,880
This incident

853
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:19,240
for our brigade,

854
00:37:19,600 --> 00:37:20,520
for the training camp,

855
00:37:21,640 --> 00:37:22,880
and for everyone involved,

856
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:24,800
is nothing to be proud of.

857
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:28,360
One must be strong to forge iron.

858
00:37:29,560 --> 00:37:30,480
Starting today,

859
00:37:30,800 --> 00:37:31,680
starting right now,

860
00:37:32,200 --> 00:37:33,480
we will focus on ideological work

861
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:35,360
and strict training.

862
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:38,120
Meeting adjourned.

863
00:37:38,240 --> 00:37:38,960
Stand up!

864
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:56,920
Captain, I got this.

865
00:37:58,240 --> 00:37:58,760
Careful.

866
00:37:59,080 --> 00:37:59,640
Yes, sir.

867
00:38:00,040 --> 00:38:00,840
Handle with care.

868
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:01,880
Yes, sir.

869
00:38:03,880 --> 00:38:04,360
Captain.

870
00:38:05,720 --> 00:38:07,160
Make sure to record all this clearly.

871
00:38:08,120 --> 00:38:09,200
Be careful, everyone.

872
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:10,480
Don't worry.

873
00:38:13,080 --> 00:38:13,640
Guo Zijian!

874
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:15,400
Here!

875
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,400
Director.

876
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:23,200
How is it?

877
00:38:23,840 --> 00:38:25,360
Looks like you're quite energized

878
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:26,680
working as the Support Captain.

879
00:38:28,680 --> 00:38:30,600
Cherishing every hard-earned opportunity.

880
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:33,000
These days,

881
00:38:33,160 --> 00:38:34,760
keep a close eye on Lin Yihu for me.

882
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:37,360
If he makes another mistake,

883
00:38:37,520 --> 00:38:38,640
no one will be able to save him.

884
00:38:40,240 --> 00:38:41,880
This administrative major demerit...

885
00:38:42,040 --> 00:38:43,200
isn't it a bit too harsh?

886
00:38:44,080 --> 00:38:44,800
Harsh?

887
00:38:44,920 --> 00:38:47,160
He's lucky he wasn't stripped of his uniform.

888
00:38:47,840 --> 00:38:49,400
Regardless of the reason,

889
00:38:49,800 --> 00:38:51,360
it was a severe disciplinary violation.

890
00:38:51,600 --> 00:38:53,040
The impact it caused was extremely bad.

891
00:38:53,200 --> 00:38:54,600
That's unforgivable, you know?

892
00:38:54,720 --> 00:38:55,240
Understood.

893
00:38:55,680 --> 00:38:56,160
It's my fault.

894
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:57,440
I didn't discipline him well.

895
00:38:57,920 --> 00:38:59,120
You took a penalty

896
00:38:59,400 --> 00:39:00,560
along with him.

897
00:39:00,560 --> 00:39:01,240
Satisfied?

898
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:03,680
Director,

899
00:39:04,840 --> 00:39:06,480
what happened this time

900
00:39:06,880 --> 00:39:08,760
was a profound lesson for both me and Lin Yihu.

901
00:39:09,240 --> 00:39:10,160
I assure you,

902
00:39:10,240 --> 00:39:11,200
there won't be a next time.

903
00:39:11,560 --> 00:39:12,160
Alright,

904
00:39:12,360 --> 00:39:13,320
save the pretty words.

905
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:14,960
I'm here this time

906
00:39:15,480 --> 00:39:16,760
to give you a task.

907
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:18,000
Your orders, sir.

908
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,400
You should know that

909
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:25,480
if we want our training to achieve a breakthrough,

910
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:28,000
we need a batch of high-tech equipment.

911
00:39:28,960 --> 00:39:31,600
Be it electronic communications or navigation systems,

912
00:39:31,600 --> 00:39:33,400
including new types of drones,

913
00:39:33,680 --> 00:39:35,560
we have no way to equip the troops with them.

914
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:38,400
The training camp has no special funds for this.

915
00:39:39,520 --> 00:39:40,880
But after our discussion,

916
00:39:41,880 --> 00:39:43,360
we realized that you,

917
00:39:43,640 --> 00:39:44,200
being smart

918
00:39:44,560 --> 00:39:45,400
and quick-witted,

919
00:39:45,600 --> 00:39:47,600
and having worked as an academic staff officer,

920
00:39:48,360 --> 00:39:50,120
should have plenty of resources.

921
00:39:50,640 --> 00:39:52,560
So, with approval from our superiors,

922
00:39:53,040 --> 00:39:54,840
we are assigning you another special task.

923
00:39:56,080 --> 00:39:56,720
I want you

924
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:58,400
to figure out a way

925
00:39:59,120 --> 00:40:01,360
to contact local military enterprises

926
00:40:01,680 --> 00:40:03,320
and secure their support.

927
00:40:05,840 --> 00:40:07,640
Aren't you just asking me to beg for handouts?

928
00:40:08,200 --> 00:40:09,240
Watch your mouth.

929
00:40:09,240 --> 00:40:11,000
Begging? How awful does that sound.

930
00:40:12,440 --> 00:40:13,000
Well,

931
00:40:13,800 --> 00:40:14,720
your travel expenses

932
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:15,960
and normal expenditures,

933
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:18,120
we can guarantee all of that.

934
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:20,720
So, whether it's private enterprises

935
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:21,760
or state-owned ones,

936
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:23,160
as long as you beg the equipment out of them...

937
00:40:23,640 --> 00:40:24,840
No, as long as you get the equipment for me,

938
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:25,960
I'll consider it a merit for you.

939
00:40:27,200 --> 00:40:27,760
Remember,

940
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:30,200
this concerns the quality of our training and teaching.

941
00:40:30,600 --> 00:40:31,920
You must get it done.

942
00:40:32,520 --> 00:40:33,280
I'll give it a try then.

943
00:40:33,320 --> 00:40:34,560
This isn't about trying.

944
00:40:35,480 --> 00:40:36,840
You must get it done.

945
00:40:38,840 --> 00:40:39,200
Also,

946
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:40,920
your

947
00:40:41,240 --> 00:40:42,040
support work

948
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:43,000
can't fall behind either.

949
00:40:43,720 --> 00:40:44,120
Yes, sir.

950
00:40:45,080 --> 00:40:46,320
Keep up the good work. I'm leaving.

951
00:40:47,360 --> 00:40:48,200
Take care, Director.

952
00:40:48,960 --> 00:40:49,600
You must.

953
00:40:56,200 --> 00:40:56,800
Xiaoshan,

954
00:40:58,480 --> 00:40:59,280
listen,

955
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:00,840
I have a task for you.

956
00:41:01,520 --> 00:41:02,160
Bro,

957
00:41:02,520 --> 00:41:03,880
we just provide the platform.

958
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:05,640
I can give you their products

959
00:41:05,640 --> 00:41:07,000
for you guys to test out,

960
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:09,840
but if you cause damage from improper use,

961
00:41:09,840 --> 00:41:10,760
you'll have to pay for it.

962
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:12,120
Don't worry about that.

963
00:41:12,280 --> 00:41:13,760
Our training is very professional.

964
00:41:14,600 --> 00:41:16,800
Alright, then in a couple of days,

965
00:41:17,080 --> 00:41:19,240
I'll bring reps from two manufacturers over.

966
00:41:19,240 --> 00:41:20,600
We'll sign an agreement.

967
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:23,280
But your final training parameters,

968
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:24,480
you have to share them with the manufacturers.

969
00:41:24,520 --> 00:41:25,120
No problem.

970
00:41:25,640 --> 00:41:26,680
I guarantee it.

971
00:41:27,440 --> 00:41:27,840
By the way,

972
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:30,360
about Wu Dongsheng,

973
00:41:30,600 --> 00:41:31,600
how is that going?

974
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:34,360
This is why we're siblings.

975
00:41:34,360 --> 00:41:35,880
I'm going to take care of it right now.

976
00:41:36,080 --> 00:41:36,720
Okay, okay, okay.

977
00:41:36,880 --> 00:41:37,200
Alright.

978
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:38,720
Remember,

979
00:41:39,400 --> 00:41:41,200
don't let him know we're related.

980
00:41:41,360 --> 00:41:41,920
Got it?

981
00:41:42,520 --> 00:41:44,400
Of course. You can count on me.

982
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:01,000
Look at yourself.

983
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:04,040
You're not cut out for business at all.

984
00:42:04,480 --> 00:42:05,320
Think about it.

985
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:07,800
Working at our village enterprise would be so nice.

986
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:09,840
The work isn't hard,

987
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,400
and you get a monthly salary.

988
00:42:12,200 --> 00:42:13,800
That's surely better than messing around with

989
00:42:13,920 --> 00:42:15,360
this scrap metal, right?

990
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:17,120
Uncle Liugen,

991
00:42:18,120 --> 00:42:19,280
just stop trying to persuade me.

992
00:42:20,400 --> 00:42:22,040
Even though I'm disabled now,

993
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:24,560
I don't want to just coast by over there.

994
00:42:24,960 --> 00:42:25,640
Besides,

995
00:42:26,520 --> 00:42:28,160
I have my own things I want to do.

996
00:42:28,560 --> 00:42:30,880
Can this scrap metal put food on the table?

997
00:42:31,040 --> 00:42:32,040
If you do this,

998
00:42:32,080 --> 00:42:32,880
others will think

999
00:42:32,880 --> 00:42:35,320
we don't care about looking after our veterans.

1000
00:42:35,400 --> 00:42:36,240
Uncle,

1001
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:38,640
I've already explained it to the town officials.

1002
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:40,200
This is my own choice.

1003
00:42:43,360 --> 00:42:44,080
You

1004
00:42:44,760 --> 00:42:46,200
are such a stubborn mule.

1005
00:42:46,680 --> 00:42:48,160
You must be Boss Wu Dongsheng, right?

1006
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:51,720
And you are?
